{"version":"1","week":2,"level":"A1","pool":"training","fullTest":false,"yearExpansion":"year-expansion-69","sourceMaterialId":"expand-w02-read-1","source":{"schemaVersion":2,"kind":"derived-original","rights":"项目原创，AI辅助编写；模拟场景与数据","verification":"reviewed","method":"从本次新原创阅读派生的规则、原句词与不同情境输出；不改名复用旧源。","model":"deepseek-flash","contentHash":"a5c817abd37dfaf4edb2880ea87727c8ae8869d792bbafe9bc0584bca57d8346","contentHashFields":["title","instructions","passage","questions"],"yearExpansion":"year-expansion-69","practiceOnly":true,"independentAssessmentEligible":false,"independentTransferEligible":false,"sourceId":"expand-w02-read-1","parentContentHash":"e5ccf8fd5c1401e2035ffd734207763929ae6d7538cc16aa88f30ac88d311932"},"questions":[{"id":"q1","type":"single","prompt":"______ is a doctor. (指男性)","options":["He","She","It"],"answers":["He"],"explanation":"指男性用 he。","evidence":"Tom is a teacher. He is from Canada."},{"id":"q2","type":"single","prompt":"______ is a nurse. (指女性)","options":["He","She","It"],"answers":["She"],"explanation":"指女性用 she。","evidence":"Lily is a nurse. She is from China."},{"id":"q3","type":"single","prompt":"______ is a cat. (指动物)","options":["He","She","It"],"answers":["It"],"explanation":"指动物用 it。","evidence":"Tom has a cat. It is white."},{"id":"q4","type":"single","prompt":"This is ______ apple.","options":["a","an"],"answers":["an"],"explanation":"apple 以元音音素开头，用 an。这里要表达的是非特定的单数名词短语 an apple。","evidence":"a / an 规则：元音音素前用 an。"},{"id":"q5","type":"single","prompt":"That is ______ book.","options":["a","an"],"answers":["a"],"explanation":"book 以辅音音素开头，用 a。这里要表达的是非特定的单数名词短语 a book。","evidence":"a / an 规则：辅音音素前用 a。"},{"id":"q6","type":"single","prompt":"______ is my bag. (指近处)","options":["This","That"],"answers":["This"],"explanation":"指近处用 this。","evidence":"This is the kitchen."},{"id":"q7","type":"single","prompt":"______ is your pen. (指远处)","options":["This","That"],"answers":["That"],"explanation":"指远处用 that。","evidence":"That is the bathroom."},{"id":"q8","type":"single","prompt":"The cat ______ white.","options":["is","are"],"answers":["is"],"explanation":"cat 是单数，用 is。","evidence":"It is white."}],"id":"expand-w02-read-1-grammar","skill":"grammar","type":"grammar","estimatedMinutes":20,"title":"The New Flatmate · 规则与新语境练习","instructions":"先阅读本组中文规则与原句，区分新结构和已学规则，再完成独立句子；同一材料再次出现属于巩固，保持原ID。","passage":"英语中，he 指男性，she 指女性，it 指事物或动物。is 用于单数主语。a 用在辅音音素开头的单数名词前，an 用在元音音素开头的单数名词前。this 指近处的人或物，that 指远处的人或物。单数名词表示一个人或一个物。\n\nTom is a teacher. She is from China. It is white. This is the kitchen. That is the bathroom."}